                <invention-title lang="de">INFUSIONSGESCHMIERTER ATHEREKTOMIEKATHETER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CATHÉTER LUBRIFIÉ D'ATHÉRECTOMIE DE PERFUSION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">INFUSION LUBRICATED ATHERECTOMY CATHETER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention discloses a matter elimination catheter, comprising: a catheter body extending from a catheter proximal portion to a catheter distal portion, the catheter body including an infusion lumen; a drive shaft disposed within the infusion lumen; a rotatable cutting member secured to a distal end of the drive shaft and rotatable through rotation of the drive shaft; and a guide wire liner extending through the drive shaft to define a guide wire lumen therein, wherein the guide wire liner extends distal of the distal end of the drive shaft into a bore of the cutting member.</p>
            </abstract>
